### Login
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "superadmin",
  "password": "admin"
}

### Activate
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/activate
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "token": "valid-invite-token",
  "password": "newSecurePassword123"
}

### Forgot Password
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/forgot-password
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "user@example.com"
}

### Reset Password
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/reset-password
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "token": "valid-reset-token",
  "newPassword": "brandNewPassword123"
}

### Refresh Token (cookie — the body is optional)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/refresh
Cookie: refresh_token=valid-refresh-token

### Refresh Token (body — deprecated)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/refresh
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "refreshToken": "valid-refresh-token"
}

### Logout (also clears the refresh_token cookie)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/logout
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}

### Stream ticket (single use, 60 s) — then GET /api/live/stream?ticket=<ticket>
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/stream-ticket
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}

### Current User (Me)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}

### My Companies
GET http://localhost:8080/api/companies
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}
